{
    "title": "GolfFix | AI Coach Golf Lesson",
    "description": "GolfFix is where you start your stress-free golf life. Tired of finding the right golf coach? Feeling stuck with your golf skills even though you are getting your lessons? Feeling frustrated because of inconsistent golf swing? Wanting to get longer distance? GolfFix can solve all your problems!\r\n\r\nGolfFix is a superb and precise golf swing analyzer and AI golf coach just for you. All you have to do is get your swing analysis & reports and practice with GolfFix.\r\n\r\nOnly GolfFix can give:\r\n\r\n[Rhythm\u2022Tempo Analysis & Practice Drill]\r\n- Analyzation of your golf swing\u2019s rhythm and tempo\r\n- Break down your swing into 4 parts to calculate the accurate rhythm and tempo; swing tempo, backswing, top pause, downswing\r\n- Practice Drills to make your rhythm and tempo consistent\r\n- Compare your rhythm and tempo with pro\u2019s and other users\u2019\r\n\r\n[Monthly AI Report]\r\n- Monthly Reports are provided to see the results of your golf lesson with GolfFix\r\n- Compare and check your progress with yourself and other users\u2019\r\n- Check the most commonly occurred issue of your golf swing\r\n- Check the most improved issue of your golf swing\r\n- Track how many days of the month you\u2019ve practiced\r\n- Check your average posture score over the month and compare your lowest and highest scored swing\r\n\r\nWhat others can also give but GolfFix is the best at:\r\n\r\n[Swing Analysis]\r\n- auto swing detection\r\n- auto create swing sequence & draw swing plane\r\n- precise issue detection\r\n- detailed explanation of the issue and solution\r\n- get instant analysis from both recording and imported video\r\n- compare your swing with pro\u2019s\r\n\r\n[Focus Drill]\r\n- Provides the right practice drills according to your level and swing style\r\n- instant analysis and feedback on every practice swing you\u2019ve made - no time to waste!\r\n\r\nWith GolfFix, today is the best day of your golf life.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n[Notice]\r\n- If any problem or error occurs while using Golf Fix, please don\u2019t hesitate to leave comments.\r\n- Any suggestions for new features are always welcomed and appreciated.\r\n- Inquiry : [help@golffix.io](mailto:help@golffix.io)\r\n- Privacy Policy : https://www.moais.co.kr/golffix-terms-en-privacyinfo\r\n- the terms of use: https://www.moais.co.kr/golffix-terms-en-tos\r\n\r\n[Subscription Notice]\r\n- After the free trial or promotional discount period, the monthly or annual subscription fee (including VAT) will be automatically charged every billing cycle.\r\n- Subscription cancellation is only possible on the payment platform used, and service can be used during the remaining period upon cancellation.\r\n- Please check the policies of each platform for confirmation and refunds of payment amounts.\r\n- If you have not been upgraded to a subscribed member after payment completion, you can restore your purchase through \"Restore Purchase History\".\r\n- By subscribing, you agree to the terms of use.\r\n\r\n[Mandatory Access Authorization]\r\n- Storage: Swing analysis data record and save, Import video\r\n- Camera: Record video",
    "descriptionHTML": "GolfFix is where you start your stress-free golf life. Tired of finding the right golf coach? Feeling stuck with your golf skills even though you are getting your lessons? Feeling frustrated because of inconsistent golf swing? Wanting to get longer distance? GolfFix can solve all your problems!<br><br>GolfFix is a superb and precise golf swing analyzer and AI golf coach just for you. All you have to do is get your swing analysis &amp; reports and practice with GolfFix.<br><br>Only GolfFix can give:<br><br>[Rhythm\u2022Tempo Analysis &amp; Practice Drill]<br>- Analyzation of your golf swing\u2019s rhythm and tempo<br>- Break down your swing into 4 parts to calculate the accurate rhythm and tempo; swing tempo, backswing, top pause, downswing<br>- Practice Drills to make your rhythm and tempo consistent<br>- Compare your rhythm and tempo with pro\u2019s and other users\u2019<br><br>[Monthly AI Report]<br>- Monthly Reports are provided to see the results of your golf lesson with GolfFix<br>- Compare and check your progress with yourself and other users\u2019<br>- Check the most commonly occurred issue of your golf swing<br>- Check the most improved issue of your golf swing<br>- Track how many days of the month you\u2019ve practiced<br>- Check your average posture score over the month and compare your lowest and highest scored swing<br><br>What others can also give but GolfFix is the best at:<br><br>[Swing Analysis]<br>- auto swing detection<br>- auto create swing sequence &amp; draw swing plane<br>- precise issue detection<br>- detailed explanation of the issue and solution<br>- get instant analysis from both recording and imported video<br>- compare your swing with pro\u2019s<br><br>[Focus Drill]<br>- Provides the right practice drills according to your level and swing style<br>- instant analysis and feedback on every practice swing you\u2019ve made - no time to waste!<br><br>With GolfFix, today is the best day of your golf life.<br><br>--------